Id: krb002i
Severity: INFO
Category: accounts
Check: check_kerberos
References: krb5.conf(5)
Controls: CIS 3.10; NIST SC-13; ISO 8.24; CE Secure configuration

rc4-hmac is among the permitted Kerberos enctypes. Keep it only
while old Active Directory servers need it: its keys are only as
strong as the password behind them, so move what you can to AES.
